===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Having a [[fast]] [[pace]], [[tempo]], or [[beat]].
#: {{ux|en|The notes are easy, but it's an '''upbeat''' tune and should be played fairly quickly.}}
# Having a [[positive]], [[lively]], or [[perky]] [[tone]], [[attitude]], etc.
#: {{ux|en|Though he had bad news, he ended with an '''upbeat''' forecast for the future.}}
#: {{ux|en|He sounded '''upbeat''' when I talked to him.}}

